{"parse": {"title": "3RD-12", "pageid": 6082, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-11\" title=\"3RD-11\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">3RD-12</span><a href=\"/wiki/3RD-13\" title=\"3RD-13\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">3RD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">12</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.BB.9A.E7.83.AB.E7.9A.84.E6.B3.AA.E6.B0.B4\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"滚烫的泪水\">滚烫的泪水</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 滚烫的泪水</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Burning Tears</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>一<span class=\"color-value\"></span>阵<span class=\"color-value\"></span>浓<span class=\"color-value\"></span>郁<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>烟<span class=\"color-value\"></span>雾<span class=\"color-value\"></span>向<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>袭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>来<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>很<span class=\"color-value\"></span>快<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>我<span class=\"color-value\"></span>们<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>此<span class=\"color-value\"></span>痛<span class=\"color-value\"></span>哭<span class=\"color-value\"></span>流<span class=\"color-value\"></span>涕<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 10312</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"gaocengbangongshi\"><img alt=\"gaocengbangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/600px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/900px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b1/Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-gaocengbangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>第一防线学校的事情已经调查清楚了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>受重塑宣传单的影响，一名叫维尔汀的女孩组织了约二十名学生，在巡礼演出上唱了改编的校歌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>校长理查德和安监主任口头劝阻失败，遂动用了特勤警卫、苦哑巴药剂和防暴枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>冲突中防暴枪不慎击中维尔汀大腿，她因此陷入昏迷。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>在校医院的救治下，现在已康复出院。今天应该已回归校园。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>……一步劣着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>您指的是哪一方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁摇摇头。似乎不打算继续评价。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这些学生的诉求是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>他们想了解外面的世界。……特别是，关于“暴雨”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"506801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"506801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-506801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-506801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这个维尔汀，是我们所知道的那个维尔汀吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>出现“暴雨”时手伸到铁门外抓小青蛙的那个——维尔汀？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>是的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我还记得，报告上说她的手臂沾上了雨水。但她没出现一点变化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>甚至都没有发炎，腐烂，变形，得一点正常人该得的病症。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>她很特别。让我想起了她的母亲。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>……我没有见过她的母亲，这似乎是个遗憾。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>康斯坦丁回到了棋桌前。她的眼睛透着一股隐隐的光。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>转告理查德：学校现进入特殊监察时期。接下来将由基金委全面接管。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">Z：</div><div>您打算做什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这一着我们是劣势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>他们如此小题大做，直接将那群小孩推到了对立面。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>猜忌的种子已经在孩子们的心中种下了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>这场风波影响深远，重塑很快就会开始行动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>而我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>我需要维尔汀成长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">康斯坦丁：</div><div>——以我喜欢的方式。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\"><img alt=\"diyifangxianxuexiao\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/600px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/900px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/5f/Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png/1200px-Cg-diyifangxianxuexiao.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>当奥利图欧感到紧张时，它很有可能会主动攻击人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">教员：</div><div>在这个时候，我们需要尽可能地俯下身体，不做任何会激怒它的举动……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一个打开的笔记本从课桌的另一侧安静地传过来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是这一周的课堂笔记。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我……我想你可能需要这个。</div></div><div class=\"tabber\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first style-choice\" style=\"margin:0 -3px 6px\"><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"1\">谢谢你 </div><div class=\"tabber-filter-item filter-button\" data-type=\"storyselect\" data-storyselect=\"2\">你很少会主动跟我说话 </div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"1\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>不客气。你的伤好一些了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我听说你昏迷了两天。</div></div></div></div><div class=\"tabber-item\" data-storyselect=\"2\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我以前可能对你有一些误会。很抱歉……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>你的身体恢复得还好吗？我听说你昏迷了两天。</div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>还行，现在不怎么痛了。催泪弹烧起来的时候比较疼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>十四行诗低下了头。她似乎不知道该说什么好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>那首歌……很好听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……很高兴听到你这么说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>不过我们不会再唱了。除了我之外，其他的同学应该还在禁闭室里吧……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507210.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507210.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/HeadIconSmall-507210.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507210.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>嗯，听说那里的环境很差……我想进去送饭，但是被教员拒绝了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>他们下个星期就会被放出来……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507201.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507201.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/21/HeadIconSmall-507201.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507201.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">十四行诗：</div><div>我的笔记可以借给他们任何一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>谢谢你的好意。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"507701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"507701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a6/HeadIconSmall-507701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-507701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">维尔汀：</div><div>希望它还能派上用场。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "3RD-12"}}